 <div class="wrap">
  <header class="room-head">
    <div><span class="kicker">Nº 004 · Founder, full stack and design</span><h2 class="room-name">Papayal</h2></div>
    <div>
      <p class="standfirst">People who work abroad send cash home and have no say in what it becomes. Papayal lets them buy a digital gift card in dollars for a specific business in Ecuador: a pharmacy, a phone top-up, a pet shop. Their family receives it on their phone and pays with it at the counter.</p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Founder. Product, design and all code</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Surfaces</dt><dd>Web, merchant portal, admin, API, iOS, Android</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Money</dt><dd>USD in, redeemed in store in Ecuador</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Model</dt><dd>Buyer fee plus merchant commission</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Status</dt><dd>Early access, first merchants</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <div class="chips"><span>Rails 7.2</span><span>Ruby 3.3</span><span>PostgreSQL</span><span>Redis + Sidekiq</span><span>Stripe PaymentIntents</span><span>Devise + JWT</span><span>Pundit</span><span>Rack::Attack</span><span>Hotwire</span><span>Tailwind v4</span><span>GSAP</span><span>React Native (Expo)</span></div>
    </div>
  </header>

